| Feature | **Gran Plaza Madrid** (Hotel A) | **Royal City Suites** (Hotel B) |
|---------|---------------------------------|---------------------------------|
| **Hotel ID** | `H001` | `H002` |
| **Address** | Plaza Mayor 1, Madrid | Calle de Alcalá 45, Madrid |
| **Accessible rooms** | 12 % of rooms (roll‑in shower, grab bars, lowered door handles) | 15 % of rooms (roll‑in shower, grab bars, lowered door handles) |
| **Wheelchair assistance** | Free on‑site wheelchair + staff assistance for check‑in/out | Free on‑site wheelchair + staff assistance (request needed) |
| **Accessible parking** | Dedicated spot (free) | Dedicated spot (free) |
| **Check‑in** | 3 pm – 10 pm | 2 pm – 10 pm |
| **Check‑out** | 11 am – 2 pm | 10 am – 2 pm |
| **Cancellation policy** | Free cancellation up to 48 h before arrival | Free cancellation up to 24 h before arrival |
| **Pet policy** | Pets not allowed in accessible rooms | Pets allowed in accessible rooms (extra fee) |
| **Smoking policy** | Strict no‑smoking (all rooms & common areas) | Designated outdoor smoking area; no smoking inside rooms |
| **Wi‑Fi** | Free high‑speed Wi‑Fi (all rooms & common areas) | Free high‑speed Wi‑Fi (all rooms & common areas) |
| **Accessibility features** | • Roll‑in shower<br>• Grab bars in bathroom<br>• Lowered door handles<br>• Accessible elevators<br>• Accessible reception desk | • Roll‑in shower<br>• Grab bars in bathroom<br>• Lowered door handles<br>• Accessible elevators<br>• Accessible reception desk |
| **Other amenities** | • Accessible fitness centre<br>• Accessible spa & sauna | • Accessible fitness centre<br>• Accessible spa & sauna |
| **Accessibility rating** | ★★★★★ (5/5) | ★★★★☆ (4/5) |

### Quick take‑away

| What matters most for wheelchair users | Gran Plaza Madrid | Royal City Suites |
|---------------------------------------|-------------------|-------------------|
| **Room accessibility** | 12 % of rooms – fully equipped | 15 % of rooms – fully equipped |
| **On‑site wheelchair** | Free, staff‑assisted | Free, staff‑assisted (request needed) |
| **Parking** | Dedicated spot, free | Dedicated spot, free |
| **Check‑in flexibility** | 3 pm–10 pm | 2 pm–10 pm |
| **Check‑out flexibility** | 11 am–2 pm | 10 am–2 pm |
| **Cancellation** | 48 h free | 24 h free |
| **Pet‑friendly** | No pets in accessible rooms | Pets allowed (extra fee) |
| **Smoking** | No smoking anywhere | Designated outdoor smoking area |
| **Overall accessibility rating** | ★★★★★ | ★★★★☆ |

**Bottom line:**  
Both hotels are fully wheelchair‑accessible and offer free on‑site wheelchairs and dedicated parking.  
- If you value a longer free‑cancellation window and a stricter no‑smoking environment, **Gran Plaza Madrid** is the better pick.  
- If you’re traveling with a pet or prefer a slightly higher proportion of accessible rooms, **Royal City Suites** may suit you better.

